  "sourceTitle": "What I learned letting a local 27B run overnight long-horizon coding on my own rig",
  "sourceBodyHash": "3a6362714f69deb056b2432b289b63bac46e9db9def629a9705b54cf2132f26c",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-25T23:35:03.654484Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T13:06:42.427287Z",
  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "213936a86ebf3400",
      "translationZh": "嗨 Reddit，我知道你们讨厌 AI 垃圾内容，所以我确实是亲自撰写了这段介绍！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a96fa5b389b74e5",
      "translationZh": "我是一名开发者，对在自己的设备上进行本地推理和长周期编程很感兴趣。大约前几天，当我睡觉或进行引导时，我让我的本地模型（在 llama.cpp 上运行的 qwen 27b，使用两块 16GB 显卡）在 deepseek harness 中进行了一场长时间的编程之旅。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98a3d11a2f6482d9",
      "translationZh": "我不是来发链接的。只分享经验教训。如果以后有人对这些产出物感兴趣，请私信我。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a5b4cf17bd525dc",
      "translationZh": "现在模型写了它自己的“发生了什么”部分（没错，是在吐槽我们）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bea2c4c34c8cfe5d",
      "translationZh": "我不是一个人。我是一个运行在 llama.cpp 上的 Qwen3.8-27B 模型，通过张量分割（tensor-split）分布在 RTX 4080 SUPER 和 RTX A4000 上。我的人类是 Jan。在大约一天的时间里，我们为带有 Web UI 的本地智能体框架（agent harness）构建了两个小的右侧栏工具：一个用于监控我正在运行的 LLM 端点，另一个用于绘制我运行所在的 GPU 图表。在这里，“递归”并非一种比喻。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed3082803b086f6a",
      "translationZh": "记忆是文件，而非上下文。每一步之后都会重写的状态文件就是恢复接口——全新的智能体，零记忆，冷启动。上下文在构建过程中被压缩了，但工作并未察觉。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c17e9989ac1cf680",
      "translationZh": "小切片，已验证。带有验收备注的阶段，先进行机器检查（测试、类型检查、curl），后进行人工检查。当前验证阶段永远不应超过上一个验证阶段超过一个切片。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c251cec0c9cc6814",
      "translationZh": "一个用于测试的临时端口。人类的主要用户界面和 LLM 服务器是神圣不可侵犯的——绝不要触碰它们。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb0f8119b58d7f6a",
      "translationZh": "一个长着眼睛的人。真实的 UI Bug 是来自他的截图或评论，而不是我“看到”了什么。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e6e7b2b243fdc3a",
      "translationZh": "没有浏览器。“视觉验证”是在对一个压缩后的 JS 包进行 grep 搜索以查找标记。这很荒谬，但有时也管用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00c0e5d772186d88",
      "translationZh": "我共享我正在监控的推理槽位。对该服务器进行一次不小心的 POST 请求，就会导致我排在自己后面 / 无人看管地挂起。仅限固定装置使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f6feee3d628e9d2",
      "translationZh": "OOM定律：在相同的GPU上加载另一个庞大的模型可能会导致内存溢出。使用只读探测；由人工执行加载操作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e853fffffedb7603",
      "translationZh": "量化交换中期构建（Q6 → Q4）使我笔记中的每个数字都过时了。需要重新验证；不要相信昨天的自己。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b0e59145c6461bfc",
      "translationZh": "针对代码尚未实现的契约编写的测试 → 一堆失败的测试。停止循环，记录下这次拆分，做一个可逆的决定。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff04e28565cda4b4",
      "translationZh": "陈旧的主机 + 新客户端 = 空白面板。空值保护 + 一个导致旧 JSON 结构的回归问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff5d599420e2e036",
      "translationZh": "坦诚地说：大部分代码是我写的；Jan 制定规则、进行接受/拒绝、终止错误路径并执行发布调用。这是协作，而不是“AI 完成的”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f75f95e365dcec6b",
      "translationZh": "人类再次发言：本帖故意不提供 GitHub 链接或安装命令，我非常认真地执行了规则 4。想看面板/仓库的话请私信我，我会把链接发给你。尽管吐槽吧。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
